style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Cancel the common factors</b><br>The primes that appear in both factorisations multiply to the greatest common divisor <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\gcd({{CT:6}},{{CT:7}})={{CT:8}}\\)</span>. Dividing the numerator and the denominator by <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:8}}\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{{{CT:2}}}{{{CT:3}}}=\\frac{{{CT:9}}\\cdot {{CT:8}}}{{{CT:10}}\\cdot {{CT:8}}}=\\frac{{{CT:9}}}{{{CT:10}}} \\]</p>Now the numerator and the denominator have no common prime factor (their gcd is 1), so the fraction is in lowest terms. In this example:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{{CT:11}}{{CT:12}} = {{CT:13}}. \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": false, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "LowestTerms", "sans": "ans", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "1-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "1-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-1-T ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">Your answer is equivalent to the correct answer, but is not in the correct form!</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-1-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-2-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-2-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["ADD", "ANN", "DD", "DR", "GG", "NN", "NR", "a", "b", "c", "ta"], "nvariants": 50}